<!-- ========== FOUR PILLARS OVERVIEW ========== -->
<section id="pillars">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">The platform</div>
    <h2 class="stitle">Four pillars. One unified profile.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Most tools do one of these. The value is in how they compound. Here's the whole platform in one view, open any pillar for the full detail.</p>

    <div class="pillars-grid">
      <a class="pillar-card" href="platform.html#unified">
        <div class="pc-head"><span class="pc-ix">01</span><span class="pc-tag">Unified</span></div>
        <h3>Six streams, one profile</h3>
        <p>DNA, microbiome, wearables, labs, environment, and self-report, fused into a single queryable profile. Nothing on the market brings all of it together.</p>
        <span class="pc-more">Explore →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="pillar-card" href="platform.html#evidence">
        <div class="pc-head"><span class="pc-ix">02</span><span class="pc-tag">Cited</span></div>
        <h3>Backed by live science</h3>
        <p>Every recommendation cites a real source (PubMed PMID) retrieved live, and the model cannot invent citations. Re-evaluated as new evidence lands.</p>
        <span class="pc-more">Explore →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="pillar-card" href="platform.html#personalized">
        <div class="pc-head"><span class="pc-ix">03</span><span class="pc-tag">Personalized</span></div>
        <h3>Your genes × your world</h3>
        <p>The same biology reads differently by genotype and local environment. Guidance adapts to <em>you</em>, not the median.</p>
        <span class="pc-more">Explore →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="pillar-card" href="platform.html#encrypted">
        <div class="pc-head"><span class="pc-ix">04</span><span class="pc-tag">Private</span></div>
        <h3>Private by design</h3>
        <p>Built so analysis runs on ciphertext, not plaintext. Blind compute is proven today on one encrypted genetic vector; scaling it across the pipeline is the current build. The trust layer, not the headline.</p>
        <span class="pc-more">Explore →</span>
